    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Tired of missing all your wide open shots in basket ball legends. Use the All Green Fade Away Basket Ball legends Macro, Easy to Use, Make Sure to Assign the Key to either &lt;&lt;E&gt;&gt; Or something easier for you to click. Feel Free to dm me for future ideas for updates on it or if its buggy

